gantt
    title Release plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    todayMarker off
    section Engine
    Parser :done, parser, 2026-10-01, 4d
    Layout :active, layout, after parser, 5d
    Renderer :crit, renderer, after layout, 3d
    section Verification
    Regression tests :tests, after parser, 6d
    Browser integration :browser, after renderer tests, 4d
    Release :milestone, release, after browser, 0d
